WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.160
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:15.190
Last time: AI in voice, photos, videos, maps

3
00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:21.010
Chapter 4 · AI Can Be Wrong Too

4
00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:27.810
Is AI always right? Let's find out!

5
00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:39.180
"Tara, play Baby Shark!"

6
00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:48.290
Oops! Tara plays a song about a baby car!

7
00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:54.870
Why did Tara get it wrong? Think!

8
00:00:54.870 --> 00:01:06.730
Tara guessed the words wrongly

9
00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:16.470
Said clearly, Tara gets it right!

10
00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:24.670
AI makes guesses. Guesses can be wrong!

11
00:01:24.670 --> 00:01:40.460
AI can make mistakes, just like people

12
00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:54.930
Puppy or muffin? Look closely!

13
00:01:54.930 --> 00:02:05.450
An AI once called a dog photo a muffin!

14
00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:19.600
Similar pattern, wrong guess

15
00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:28.310
Why does AI make mistakes? Three reasons

16
00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:41.320
1 · Too few examples

17
00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:51.620
2 · Messy examples: blurry or wrong names

18
00:02:51.620 --> 00:03:06.830
3 · Something new it has never seen

19
00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:24.160
3 blurry photos, or thousands of clear ones?

20
00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:34.370
Few, blurry examples → more mistakes

21
00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:46.570
A map app suggests a road that's closed today

22
00:03:46.570 --> 00:04:03.770
Translation mix-up: kal = yesterday or tomorrow?

23
00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:15.330
Health · Safety · Food → ask a trusted grown-up

24
00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:20.960
Never eat, touch, or go just because an app said

25
00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:30.630
AI helps. Grown-ups decide big things.

26
00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:41.900
The app says the mushroom is safe to eat!

27
00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:47.490
What should Anaya do? Think!

28
00:04:47.490 --> 00:05:00.370
Don't eat it! Ask a grown-up first.

29
00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:18.340
Which one most needs a grown-up to check?

30
00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:28.190
Medicine! Health means ask a grown-up.

31
00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:32.140
Your turn: practice check

32
00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:44.140
AI says a plant is safe to eat. Should you?

33
00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:56.400
No! AI can be wrong. Ask a grown-up first.

34
00:05:56.400 --> 00:06:01.480
AI can be wrong

35
00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:04.640
Few or messy examples cause mistakes

36
00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:10.460
Important facts? Check with a person

37
00:06:10.460 --> 00:06:13.890
AI helps. Grown-ups decide big things.

38
00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:19.640
Chapter 4 done!

39
00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:26.440
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
